10
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:45,560
Bring all your courage

11
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:48,560
And maybe save this world

12
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:51,260
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

13
00:00:54,259 --> 00:01:00,259
Sima Gang erupts!

14
00:01:24,260 --> 00:01:24,740
How's the plan coming along?

15
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:27,260
Everything is going according to your wishes

16
00:01:27,260 --> 00:01:30,439
I've found out everything

17
00:01:30,439 --> 00:01:32,560
About the toys in Tuna Town

18
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:35,080
I'm sure the plan will be foolproof

19
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:37,340
We of the Golden Tooth Gang believe

20
00:01:37,340 --> 00:01:39,340
Only with nonstop work

21
00:01:39,340 --> 00:01:40,840
Can the Earth survive

22
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:43,340
But the pitiful people

23
00:01:43,340 --> 00:01:45,280
Get two days off a week

24
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:47,820
And celebrate so many holidays

25
00:01:47,820 --> 00:01:49,560
The worst part is...

26
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:51,939
These people even make all these toys

27
00:01:51,939 --> 00:01:54,319
Just to rot people's minds from childhood

28
00:01:54,319 --> 00:01:56,099
So our Gold Tooth Gang

29
00:01:56,099 --> 00:01:57,980
Will strike and destroy Tuna Town's

30
00:01:57,980 --> 00:01:59,000
Every festival

31
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,400
Every amusement facility

32
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,280
Every toy

33
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:03,359
This Toy Mobilization of ours

34
00:02:03,359 --> 00:02:05,280
Will completely wake people up

35
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,759
Oh no

36
00:02:06,759 --> 00:02:08,360
These gold-tooth crooks

37
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:10,000
Are going to cause trouble in Tuna Town

38
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,319
I have to notify Officer Han right away

39
00:02:11,319 --> 00:02:12,860
To come and catch them all in one sweep

40
00:02:21,939 --> 00:02:24,759
Han, Officer Han

41
00:02:24,759 --> 00:02:26,680
Why are you so exhausted?

42
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:29,139
You got like this from messing around catching gold-tooths yesterday, right?

43
00:02:29,139 --> 00:02:30,180
Officer Han

44
00:02:30,180 --> 00:02:32,620
I found the gold-tooth crooks' hideout!

45
00:02:32,620 --> 00:02:49,159
Where's the Big Gold Tooth?

46
00:02:51,939 --> 00:02:56,359
There was definitely a big gold tooth here last night!

47
00:02:56,359 --> 00:02:58,659
I think YOU have gold teeth in your brain!

48
00:02:58,659 --> 00:03:02,599
I've decided

49
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:04,060
To punish you by suspending you from duty today

50
00:03:04,060 --> 00:03:05,340
Reflect properly right here

51
00:03:05,340 --> 00:03:06,719
Tomorrow, don't mention any gold teeth to me again.

52
00:03:06,719 --> 00:03:07,979
I'm heading off now.

53
00:03:07,979 --> 00:03:09,579
今天镇上的玩具店

54
00:03:09,579 --> 00:03:10,699
Got a big shipment of new stock in.

55
00:03:10,699 --> 00:03:11,860
There must be a lot of people.

56
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:13,439
I have to get back to maintain order.

57
00:03:13,439 --> 00:03:15,379
Don't come making things worse.

58
00:03:30,900 --> 00:03:32,139
Aw, so comfy~

59
00:03:32,139 --> 00:03:33,060
Don't want gold teeth, don't want gold teeth

60
00:03:41,099 --> 00:03:42,780
Toys....

61
00:03:42,780 --> 00:03:45,819
These people also made so many toys

62
00:03:45,819 --> 00:03:47,860
让 人们 从小 就 玩物丧志

63
00:03:47,860 --> 00:03:49,939
This time, we're doing Toy Story.

64
00:03:49,939 --> 00:03:51,819
It'll definitely shake people wide awake.

65
00:03:51,819 --> 00:03:56,819
Today the toy store in town got a big shipment of new stuff.

66
00:03:56,819 --> 00:04:01,239
The plan is foolproof.

67
00:04:01,239 --> 00:04:04,659
Tuna Town Toy Store

68
00:04:04,659 --> 00:04:05,959
I'm not imagining things.

69
00:04:05,959 --> 00:04:08,419
There really are bad guys going after the toy store.

70
00:04:08,419 --> 00:04:17,439
Let me go!

71
00:05:05,399 --> 00:05:06,139
Grandma,

72
00:05:06,139 --> 00:05:08,079
You got a Shar-Pei with a gold tooth?

73
00:05:08,079 --> 00:05:12,139
Hey, that's my dear mommy you're talking about!

74
00:05:12,139 --> 00:05:14,139
She likes Shar Pei dogs.

75
00:05:14,139 --> 00:05:17,579
Your mom looks about the same age as you,

76
00:05:17,579 --> 00:05:20,680
I look like I'm seventy

77
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,939
But I'm actually only seven

78
00:05:22,939 --> 00:05:25,459
Because I have an aging disease

79
00:05:25,459 --> 00:05:27,659
What are you doing here?

80
00:05:27,659 --> 00:05:29,620
I'm doing a jigsaw puzzle

81
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:32,019
But no matter what, I can't put it together

82
00:05:32,019 --> 00:05:34,120
So I'm going to kill myself

83
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,199
Little girl

84
00:05:35,199 --> 00:05:36,219
I'll help you!

85
00:05:36,219 --> 00:05:38,079
Great!

86
00:05:38,079 --> 00:05:41,120
Help me hang from that tree!

87
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,219
No!

88
00:05:42,219 --> 00:05:43,979
I'll just help you with the puzzle instead

89
00:05:43,980 --> 00:05:46,980
You're so nice, big brother!

90
00:05:48,980 --> 00:05:50,980
There are three thousand pieces here

91
00:05:51,980 --> 00:05:52,980
Three thousand!

92
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,740
Finally finished!

93
00:06:20,740 --> 00:06:23,319
Hahaha, I'm wiped out!

94
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:24,100
Can't fall down...

95
00:06:24,100 --> 00:06:26,879
Can't fall down!

96
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:35,180
Big brother

97
00:06:35,180 --> 00:06:39,840
Try on this pair!

98
00:06:43,980 --> 00:06:45,980
Not bad!

99
00:06:45,980 --> 00:06:47,600
It's eco-friendly and saves money!

100
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:52,120
I still have urgent business today

101
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,140
I'll play with you another day.

102
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:56,259
Bye-bye, big brother!

103
00:07:13,980 --> 00:07:30,220
Don't run!

104
00:07:30,220 --> 00:07:31,759
Give me back my toy

105
00:07:31,759 --> 00:07:34,259
Stop him!

106
00:07:34,259 --> 00:07:35,780
Quick, stop him, Officer Han!

107
00:07:35,780 --> 00:07:37,100
My toys!

108
00:07:37,100 --> 00:07:38,680
Who's watching the shop?

109
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:41,840
Uh oh, this is bad!

110
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:42,840
Hurry up.

111
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:58,840
Destroy him!

112
00:07:58,840 --> 00:07:59,840
Destroy him!

113
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:32,680
Don't mention the gold tooth.

114
00:08:40,680 --> 00:08:41,299
Little girl.

115
00:08:41,419 --> 00:08:46,419
不 金牙教母 你还是束手就擒 安享晚年吧

116
00:08:46,419 --> 00:08:53,039
Hahaha! You little brat! Watch the Golden Tooth Gang's ultimate move!

117
00:08:53,039 --> 00:08:57,919
The brain-dead gold-tooth laser that's already dropped your IQ by 60!

118
00:08:57,919 --> 00:09:04,459
Awesome!

119
00:09:04,459 --> 00:09:10,299
乖宝宝 出来吧 游戏结束了

120
00:09:11,419 --> 00:09:17,419
Take this!

121
00:09:17,419 --> 00:09:25,419
No!
You defended the people's right to happiness.

122
00:09:41,419 --> 00:09:45,979
Mm, all done.

123
00:09:45,979 --> 00:09:47,839
Awesome!

124
00:10:11,419 --> 00:10:18,120
【Ending Theme】

125
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:26,000
Look at tomorrow, waving to me at the horizon.

126
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:33,599
Every day, sunrise and sunset, spinning through time, dreaming of more

127
00:10:33,599 --> 00:10:38,659
Awaiting every second, every moment of life

128
00:10:38,659 --> 00:10:45,379
Bright eyes are sparkling

129
00:10:45,379 --> 00:10:48,759
A smile that basks in the sun

130
00:10:48,759 --> 00:10:53,959
Stomping through the screaming crossroads